   Also --- more germanely --- there's no such thing as a "rotproof corpse"
in Nethack, cockatrice or otherwise. All corpses rot, except for:

     * Lizards and lichens never rot.
     * Corpses in an icebox never rot.
     * Corpses on ice rot at half speed.

However, there's no way for you to wield a non-lizard, non-lichen
corpse as a weapon, unless you're willing to see it rot at normal
speed.

